<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Diagnostic, Serologicals.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Diagnostic, Serologicals.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers confirmed analyst Angus Macdonald initiated coverage of Diagnostic Products Corp with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $40.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 3/8 at 31-5/8.</p>
<p>-- also initiated Serologicals Inc with an outperform rating, and a 12-month price target of $27.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 22-3/4.</p>
</text>
